</div>
<div id="p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="1" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 1 1" width="1"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FFEBD7;--ltx-fill-color:#FFEBD7;--ltx-fg-color:#FFEBD7;" color="#FFEBD7" fill="#FFEBD7" stroke="#FFEBD7" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,1) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 59.06 1009.45 M 59.06 998.38 L 59.06 402.41 C 59.06 396.29 64.01 391.34 70.12 391.34 L 779.88 391.34 C 785.99 391.34 790.94 396.29 790.94 402.41 L 790.94 998.38 C 790.94 1004.49 785.99 1009.45 779.88 1009.45 L 70.12 1009.45 C 64.01 1009.45 59.06 1004.49 59.06 998.38 Z M 790.94 391.34"></path></g></svg></span>
